ry":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Hughes County has 75 years of record on its 8 grids, and on the middle of those grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 184% of normal in April to May and 46% in November to December. Grid 18137 had its driest year in 1963 at 53%. The preliminary estimate for grid 18436 puts August to September 2026 at 21.6, which is not final.</p>"}
